# Compiled TypeScript output next to sources. The TS compiler emits each
# .js + .js.map next to its .ts twin during dev/typecheck runs; these are
# build artifacts, not source. Globally ignored here so they don't keep
# turning up as untracked files.
app/lib/*.js
app/lib/*.js.map
app/src/*.js
app/src/*.js.map
